{"availability":"available","full":"LaurenceLungo/Light-Rail-Radar","name":"Light-Rail-Radar","description":"ETA of Hong Kong Light Rail, focused on SPEED. 極速查閱輕鐵班次，無需再用唔方便嘅MTR app!","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":6,"forks":0,"created":"2021-06-21T05:43:50Z","updated":"2026-08-05T05:21:55Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://lightrailradar.netlify.app","topics":["hongkong","mtr","progressive-web-app","pwa","react","vite"],"demo":"https://lightrailradar.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T20:31:58.115Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T20:31:58.115Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T20:31:58.115Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:50.861Z","stars":6,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T23:18:23.925Z","stars":6,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T20:31:58.115Z","stars":6,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A progressive web app (PWA) to quickly look up the estimated time of arrival (ETA) of Hong Kong Light Rail on your phone.","This project is started due to the lack of convenient ways to look up the next train of Hong Kong Light Rail. Many physical overhead displays in Light Rail platforms were taken down when MTR tried to streamline the look-up feature into its MTR Mobile app, but it failed miserably since the app is extremely inconvenient to use with a complicated UX and slow response time.","This progressive web app aims at providing the quickest and easiest way possible to look up the next light rail from your mobile."],"features":["Real-time ETA: Live updates of Light Rail arrival times","Multi-language Support: English and Chinese (Traditional)","Station Selection: Easy station picker with favorites","Location-based: Automatic nearest station detection","Progressive Web App: Installable on mobile devices"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/LaurenceLungo/Light-Rail-Radar/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9d978f634644c7abe3f1a20eefdc78356b7c0605f2df49b96